{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6e/quc3kd3ffuc9r45v46twxa3xncratwp.mp3","text":"博士，有什么我能做的事吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1e/qlxm8yb627chjmuwj5beyjww6auiv3m.mp3","text":"谢谢您的信任！今后我也会继续加油的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b9/trybwto3qmnr5y2mzzq143xvor2f7x2.mp3","text":"芙蓉和炎熔又吵架了，真让我头疼。明明是亲生姐妹啊，为什么会变成现在这样呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/7fxn30tmsx4z2mhr6cvgxhizyzopj2u.mp3","text":"我们和杜宾老师经常进行模拟比赛，不过我完全摸不透老师的技巧。如果博士和阿米娅有时间来参观训练的话，可以亲自指导我们吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8a/qzn6addzqsm112q02nlgmjtxqbyxdxt.mp3","text":"啊，我知道了，我的小队里又有人迟到了对吧。我会想办法解决的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/h05pdqpzl8qq078uc19w18bko2ml5iy.mp3","text":"我也是感染者，但并没能像炎熔那样觉醒法术天赋......","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/d3qv728rgx0mujjgdehfohv77f3ltde.mp3","text":"罗德岛给了我们容身之地，博士，所以就算拼上自己的生命，我也一定要保护好所有人。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/6mvnj56qemrk796bdx44hhn2bz9mxua.mp3","text":"米格鲁诚实可靠，克洛丝洞察力强，炎熔很聪明，芙蓉充满活力，我一直很喜欢组里的大家......只要芙蓉不再强迫我吃她新创作的可怕料理就好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/lyhvr20tfheqhtp5ieda6d3pk3z0q6m.mp3","text":"......嘘，别打扰博士休息，有事我们到外面说。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:b/be/hsv5302j6sf7z5cq6ildzoxr0p0bo6i.mp3","text":"我是芬，长枪手，现在正担任着行动预备组A1的队长一职。我和我的小队一定会竭尽全力，成为罗德岛可靠的战力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/6aw9epoc3ndoriephrb0s8jea1i9ogg.mp3","text":"感谢您的指导。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/20/5xkpavyhrj0g5cgtzyptvifntrc3i3o.mp3","text":"您的提拔是对我努力的最好肯定。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_013.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/5g9mv19sg577ju6al740u67oik19b0j.mp3","text":"请交给我。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/157n9u5pnoa9hxfnuuzma0x1zxgl8vs.mp3","text":"没问题，我很了解队长该做什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:9/92/p88a3sl2b88tdo8btayojx98bfs6iwe.mp3","text":"全体人员，出发前务必要检查随身装备是否备齐了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/aeor0gpjrjqjrp4sr6zwra7casmwuk4.mp3","text":"发现敌方单位。准备作战！","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/jdztt3ib0wj14bmquryswhqygakdc9q.mp3","text":"准备行动。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8e/dqk9vazsxm19fqbjc1iwdjfn4mndsqj.mp3","text":"准备万全。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:0/06/f3bwh45ni7uf27atim3cjdaonjj57qz.mp3","text":"各就各位。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/4r9wjexl63zprr8goqksvlebdyrj4at.mp3","text":"请交给我们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/ohjwb8tnneqdf0vmosdijo3j5woq52p.mp3","text":"刺穿。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/14/ix09e61j90p4qdf19c84hyezvd49lxc.mp3","text":"大家跟着我！","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_026.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/57wo3yo8hv4p886o8y7bpas4gl5h2z0.mp3","text":"只要有正确合理的作战计划，就算是我们这样的新手，也能赢下这样艰难的战斗！","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/t2womjwr173jf63mg0uod2bgckicwm9.mp3","text":"我们按照预定目标，完成了此次作战。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/86/smury1r2nnw2o1on5d92max87bux2td.mp3","text":"只要放走一个敌人，作战就不能说是成功的。米格鲁，下次我们也要加油。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/9zue9fxukotqtopr2oax5c02rzmq7hr.mp3","text":"非常抱歉，杜宾老师......","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/pi0bn17joaawov3akewxo3u9f9jgiv4.mp3","text":"是的，我回来了。克洛丝也在这里吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/d8428ecim1h3d0mxv43oz2txxqo7dnd.mp3","text":"啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/j1fq1fkjzg2ypmftgoajc0oc0zqkbni.mp3","text":"我帮上您的忙了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/lp0nanpwvm3m7pofymblputrfou6pq1.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cb/5ocizxyu733v3ua67tyshvj1q5bfhfi.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士，我们小队准备去聚餐，正准备去邀请杜宾老师，您也一起来吗？我也还有一些战斗上的问题......啊，抱歉，已经是节日了，我不应该再提工作的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/ls2kkuld47nrgj7218wg09r1iuxp4l9.mp3","text":"我随时都可以，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_123_fang/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/pnrz38rakmw80i3ccuxvfsymfzfv84v.mp3","text":"博士，有什么我能做的事吗？","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/bpfu2xeoowpka0o0i0hcktf8oo29fxf.mp3","text":"谢谢您的信任！今后我也会继续加油的。","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/b3ppmvh3qr8v9pnvnsp32o9ta4p5zd6.mp3","text":"芙蓉和炎熔又吵架了，真让我头疼。明明是亲生姐妹啊，为什么会变成现在这样呢......","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/06/datwencb4v5fgjaxohz8zf3gzz3v7e2.mp3","text":"我们和杜宾老师经常进行模拟比赛，不过我完全摸不透老师的技巧。如果博士和阿米娅有时间来参观训练的话，可以亲自指导我们吗？","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:9/96/7c6xbsl4j0sfsw94dx4bajvc4vp7kax.mp3","text":"啊，我知道了，我的小队里又有人迟到了对吧。我会想办法解决的。","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_005.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/m9hbk1l514uk2qqg5mgvwucwtny3rxu.mp3","text":"我也是感染者，但并没能像炎熔那样觉醒法术天赋......","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/ejd46znxn69i81dtadqlqn4pn3rfltx.mp3","text":"罗德岛给了我们容身之地，博士，所以就算拼上自己的生命，我也一定要保护好所有人。","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/27/6kjs8imgw9wsgbhrqlo9adhobk6szzn.mp3","text":"米格鲁诚实可靠，克洛丝洞察力强，炎熔很聪明，芙蓉充满活力，我一直很喜欢组里的大家......只要芙蓉不再强迫我吃她新创作的可怕料理就好......","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ec/lel62yvgvmous7ui8ok393frwwqsg7f.mp3","text":"......嘘，别打扰博士休息，有事我们到外面说。","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/86pcejjtoxa1cxgeig7jhbyfnxuuphn.mp3","text":"我是芬，长枪手，现在正担任着行动预备组A1的队长一职。我和我的小队一定会竭尽全力，成为罗德岛可靠的战力。","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:2/25/j7s9z0mmgj9l1c0bpdavkzj2f051xpg.mp3","text":"感谢您的指导。","alt":"voice/char_123_fang/cn_0